eOneblank1&quot;=0A                                                    data-pare=
nt=3D&quot;#accordionblank1&quot; aria-expanded=3D&quot;true&quot; class=3D&quot;&quot;&gt;=0A              =
                                      1. If your printer connects by a wire=
=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A         =
                                       &lt;p&gt;If your printer connects by a wir=
e,=0A                                                    plug it into your =
device. It&#039;ll connect automatically, your=0A                               =
                     PC will download the right drivers, and you can use it=
 right=0A                                                    away.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=
=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A       =
                                             2. To connect a wireless print=
er, download the latest=0A                                                 =
   driver and software package for your printer model from=0A              =
                                      the official website and follow these=
 steps:=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=
=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Select the Start b=
utton, then select Settings &gt;=0A                                           =
         Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A               =
                                     scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                       =
                         &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby printers, then ch=
oose the=0A                                                    one you want=
 to use, and select Add device. If you want=0A                             =
                       to remove the printer later, just highlight it and=
=0A                                                    select Remove.&lt;/p&gt;=
=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;h3 class=
=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A                             =
                   &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                             =
       1.Prepare your printer:=0A                                          =
      &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;Use=
 the instructions that came with your printer to=0A                        =
                            unpack the printer, install ink or toner, and a=
dd paper.=0A                                                    Turn on the=
 printer and make sure it=E2=80=99s not displaying=0A                      =
                              any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                        =
                        &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                        =
            2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions that=0A       =
                                             came with the printer to conne=
ct it to the network.=0A                                                &lt;/s=
trong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A         =
                                           If you have a Wi-Fi printer, you=
 might need to connect=0A                                                  =
  the printer to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A              =
                                      printing. After connecting the printe=
r to your Mac,=0A                                                    instal=
l the Mac software that came with the printer and=0A                       =
                             use the printer=E2=80=99s setup assistant to c=
onnect the printer=0A                                                    to=
 your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you can=0A                          =
                          disconnect the cable from your printer and Mac an=
d the=0A                                                    printer should =
remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                                  =
              &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;st=
rong&gt;=0A                                                    3. Add the prin=
ter to your list of available printers:=0A                                 =
               &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                             =
   &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    Choose Apple m=
enu &gt; System Settings, then click Printers=0A                              =
                      &amp; Scanners in the sidebar. (You may need to scroll=0A=
                                                    down.)&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A       =
                                         &lt;strong&gt;=0A                       =
                             4. When your printer appears in the list, sele=
ct your=0A                                                    printer, then=
 click Add.=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=
=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt; It may take a min=
ute or two for your printer to appear.=0A                                  =
                  If you see a message prompting you to download new=0A    =
                                                software, make sure to down=
load and install it.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                          =
      &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    5. If =
you do not see your printer listed on the left,=0A                         =
                           click the Add Printer, Scanner or Fax button on =
the=0A                                                    right.=0A        =
